        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity with positive family history and confirmed pathogenic mutation in SPG12 gene",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis; clinical presentation may overlap with other hereditary spastic paraplegias."
